// Microsoft Defender Protection Disabled
// Detects real-time protection or scanning being turned off through PowerShell or the registry, which is a routine precursor to dropping tooling that would otherwise be quarantined.
// techniques: T1562.001   severity: critical   status: stable
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1562.001
//   Set-MpPreference -DisableRealtimeMonitoring $true
// source: rules/defense-evasion/defender-disabled.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((CommandLine has_any (dynamic(["Set-MpPreference -DisableRealtimeMonitoring $true", "DisableRealtimeMonitoring 1", "Add-MpPreference -ExclusionPath", "DisableAntiSpyware"]))))
